[en.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_CONTROLLED]
Thestral Managed

[en.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_CONTROLLED_desc]
The Changeling troops sent to the Thestral territory successfully managed the restless Thestrals and the Cerberus, allowing us to take substantial control of this territory.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_CONTROLLED]
治理夜骐

[zh.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_CONTROLLED_desc]
幻形灵帝国向夜骐领地派出的军队成功治理了躁动的夜骐族群和三头犬，我们得以趁机实质控制了这片领地。

